{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n\n<p>發佈時間：20:16 2026-11-02 HKT</p>\n<p>MIRROR其中六子姜濤、陳卓賢（Ian）、李駿傑（Jeremy）、柳應廷（Jer）、邱傲然（Tiger）、楊樂文 （Lokman）今日下午現身銅鑼灣，為手機殼品牌拍攝聯乘宣傳照，大批粉絲早已到場，逼爆品牌專門店外面。在六子到達前，店員早有準備，在專門店外用鐵欄圍起粉絲區，還有約廿名保安員註足現場，維持秩序，警方也派警員到場增援。</p>\n<h2>MIRROR粉絲逼爆店外</h2>\n<p>當MIRROR六子於下午4時許現身，在場粉絲尖叫高呼偶像名字，六子向粉絲揮手示意，隨即步入品牌專門店開始拍攝工作，各自拿起專屬聯乘手機殼拍攝及受訪。每當拍攝空檔，六子除了傾偈，也有向逼爆店外的粉絲揮手互動。完成大約2小時拍攝工作後，六子不忘跟工作人員合照留念，離開時又再引起粉絲尖叫，六子向粉絲揮手道別並行後巷離開。</p>\n<img alt=\"大批粉絲早已到場！\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/4a7565423ebbdb8d2cc27f503971f5af/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-02_at_19_25_39.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"MIRROR其中六子姜濤、Ian、Jeremy、Jer、Tiger、Lokman殺到！\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/bef58cf032fe41684f0a4aefcb1c2fda/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-02_at_19_25_41.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"企定定影靚相。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/1ed9d29bfe02ba4e410d0fd65c6bbd82/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-02_at_19_25_47_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"同「鏡粉」打招呼。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/5f705d60056b4e8574101f3c83c3c40d/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-02_at_19_25_47.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"Jeremy扮廣告畀戲。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/f13b9c66e0f06d6165703076b794d640/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-02_at_19_25_48_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"姜濤好貪玩。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/97d2d122b52ef99d4080a147f8c18ea5/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-02_at_19_26_00.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"姜濤有精神。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/998790224ba5b41ff30b03f9492516f4/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-02_at_19_26_05.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"Jeremy擺型仔pose。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/419f985b85f859b2e78d3b65e29c0355/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-02_at_19_26_06_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"Jer自拍~\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/7da9265344f47be031e5ce920bc04afa/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-02_at_19_26_07.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"姜濤、Ian埋位。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/bfaec9446faceac55aa07897c453bd7f/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-02_at_19_26_08_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"姜濤伸脷。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/e0dc11a2476522cf4ca9915a9b442322/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-02_at_19_26_09_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"姜濤多表情。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/9e331fd5cefc5a2a8c8f7177eba7d77c/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-02_at_19_26_09.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"Ian魅力笑。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/9dcf08a062bd8a602e4db80356739995/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-02_at_19_26_10_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"拍完廣告收工。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/5d3ae0cdb683ad00fe9b478cba14985e/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-02_at_19_26_17.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"秩序良好。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/1bc7fc1720a17c3bab5f307c5e4bb075/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-02_at_19_26_18_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"MIRROR其中六子下午現身銅鑼灣，為手機殼品牌拍攝聯乘宣傳照。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/45aab7d5530a38284e1976c149ed7800/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-02_at_19_26_20.jpeg\"/>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T15:01:05.157841+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":364,"images":16,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-02T12:16:01+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-02T18:18:38.419156+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T14:58:44.987193+00:00","content_hash":"34f6cad564a8b0591cb10f36aeaa8137606424537ba8ba6a1edc1f9c37af9b04","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}